//! `named` uses a region parameter as a value.
//!
//! Regions erase at run time. The checker refuses the returned region as
//! `RegionAsValue`.
//!
//! The parameter appears only in the kept type of `k`.
//!
//! - see: corpus/model/regions/lent.gandr — a region parameter in a kept type

/// `named` returns its region parameter as though it were a value.
@[refuses("RegionAsValue")]
def named[r : Region](k : (() -> Integer) at r) -> Integer { pure r }
